联系方式：技术转移中心 罗老师，13927409073', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, '2026-09-18 10:27:52.235032+08', '2026-09-18 10:27:52.235032+08', NULL, 1, 'parallel', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'technology', NULL, 12);
INSERT INTO public.achievement VALUES (649, 1, NULL, '北京大学深圳研究生院', '4 项目名称： 量子点短波红外探测器', NULL, '项目英文名称：
项目简介（200-300字）
项目代表性图片或照片（1-2张），或组图（1组）
本项目聚焦量子点材料在短波红外探测领域的技术突破，创新研发基于高性能胶体量子点的红外探测器芯片。采用多配体策略和液相外延技术实现配体-量子点的强耦合。采用探测端-CMOS读出电路一体化集成技术，通过开发适配量子点的电荷传输材料及透明电极材料，使焦平面探测器具有低暗电流、高量子效率及宽光谱响应，解决传统红外探测器成本高、集成难的行业痛点。应用场景覆盖工业检测、智能驾驶、智能安防及医疗设备等细分赛道，精准对接中小企业技术升级及高端设备国产化需求。产品依托量子点材料低成本制备、CMOS一体化集成及室温工作的独特优势，相较InGaAs探测器成本降低80%以上，核心性能达到国际先进水平，构建技术壁垒与性价比双重竞争优势，助力我国红外探测产业自主可控发展。
芯片晶圆
量子点探测器芯片
短波红外夜视相机', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, '2026-09-18 10:27:52.250161+08', '2026-09-18 10:27:52.250161+08', NULL, 1, 'parallel', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'technology', NULL, 13);
INSERT INTO public.achievement VALUES (650, 1, NULL, '北京大学深圳研究生院', '4 项目名称：量子点短波红外探测器', NULL, '可应用领域（对应深圳20+8产业）
半导体与集成电路+光载信息
技术成熟度与项目进展（100字以内）
项目成熟度已达第8级，完成中试及小规模量产。现已实现高品质关键材料的批量化合成；高稳定性量子点电子墨水；液相集成工艺开发；成像芯片开发与集成等核心技术的8寸晶圆中试级量产。
技术创新点(100-300字)
（1）实现粒径均一的短波红外量子点的可控合成和至少百克级量产，实现量子点高效可控的配体交换后性质稳定的电子墨水，并开发专门针对短波红外的顶入射透明导电电极。
（2）本项目实现量子点短波红外探测器的暗电流和InGaAs探测器基本一致，量子效率达到70%以上。
（3）芯片基于项目团队在微电子、人工智能等领域研究基础，基于CMOS工艺，集成了高灵敏度像素电路及读出电路，通过优化像素的尺寸和特性，实现对微弱信号的高效捕获和转换，以及信号在传输过程中的完整性和准确性。', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, '2026-09-18 10:27:52.272155+08', '2026-09-18 10:27:52.272155+08', NULL, 1, 'parallel', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'technology', NULL, 14);
INSERT INTO public.achievement VALUES (2, 2, 162, '中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院', 'Vision-Tactile Integrated Intelligent Perception – Robotic Compliant Precision Assembly System', 9, 'Focusing on application scenarios in the processing, manufacturing, and assembly of precision electronic components in the 3C industry, the Research Center for Machine Vision team has independently developed a 4D structured-light imaging camera. Through dynamic vision-tactile perception feedback, it achieves seamless integration with robotic assembly systems. This breakthrough addresses long-standing bottlenecks in traditional manufacturing processes caused by large deviations in incoming materials, which lead to limited recognition ranges in plug-in testing, low accuracy, high failure rates, and the inability to dynamically adjust or correct errors. The system significantly enhances the dynamic target perception and fine manipulation capabilities of robot hand–eye coordination. It enables efficient and precise insertion and assembly of multiple series of electronic connectors, including HDMI, USB, Type-C, and FPC flexible flat connectors, thereby empowering industrial quality inspection and assembly testing.', NULL, '02_lab', NULL, NULL, '[{"title": "Key Technological Innovations", "content": "High-speed, high-precision 4D real-time dynamic 3D reconstruction and 6D pose recognition provide strong data support for compensating incoming deviations and pose adjustments of various types of connectors, enabling dynamic and continuous error correction."}, {"title": "Technology Readiness Level", "content": "Prototype components of the laboratory principle system are first validated in the experimental environment, and then gradually extended to joint testing and verification with manufacturing enterprises."}, {"title": "Project Support", "content": "This work was supported by the Guangdong Provincial Key Research and Development Program (Special Project) and Guangdong Provincial Natural Science Foundation ."}, {"title": "Applicable Fields", "content": "Application scenarios include high-end equipment manufacturing and processing, as well as industrial quality inspection, plug-in testing, wire harness sub-assembly, and precision assembly of precision electronic components in the 3C industry."}]', 'negotiable', NULL, NULL, 'SongZhan', NULL, '15889608167', 'zhan.song@siat.ac.cn', NULL, 'published', NULL, 1, 4, '2026-05-19 21:05:45+08', '2026-05-19 21:05:45+08', '2026-09-15 14:27:24.334284+08', NULL, 2, 'parallel', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'technology', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.achievement VALUES (651, 1, NULL, '北京大学深圳研究生院', '4 团队简介', NULL, 'Introduction of the Inventor of the Achievement
